              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CoincidenceOfTransformsForAdjointTriple"}
            %p
              For the second statement, notice that the
              = succeed "-" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
