              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/idempotent+monad"} idempotency
              of the adjunctions.)
            %p
              From this we obtain the following
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commuting+diagram"} commuting diagram
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable
                        %mtr
