                  is the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/left+Kan+extension"} left Kan extension
                  along the inclusion
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
