                    \\,.
            %p
              The fact that this indeed preserves products follows from the assumption that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝒞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
              has
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+products"} finite products
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categories+with+finite+products+are+cosifted"} categories with finite products are cosifted
              (
              %a{:href => "geometry+of+physics+--+categories+and+toposes#CategoriesWithFiniteProductsAreCosifted"}> this prop.
              )
          %p
            Example
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PresheavesAdjointQuadrupleOnSiteWithTerminalObject"}
            suggests to ask for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coverages"} coverages
            on categories with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finite+products"} finite products
            which are such that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+quadruple"} adjoint quadruple
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:PreaheafAdjointQuadruple"} (7)
            on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+of+presheaves"} category of presheaves
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/corestriction"}> co-
            )
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/restriction"} restricts
            to the corresponding
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+of+sheaves"} category of sheaves
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#OneCohesiveSite"}
            states a sufficient condition for this to be the case:
          #OneCohesiveSite.num_defn
            %h6#definition_10 Definition
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesive+site"}> cohesive site
                )
            %p
